  "verbalization": "Decyl propionate appears to have a shared target, SNU-387, with multiple pathways leading to HCC1937. These pathways involve different compounds that are targets of SNU-387, suggesting a complex network of interactions. The evidence indicates that Decyl propionate may influence HCC1937 through a series of molecular interactions, potentially via SNU-387 as a central mediator. The presence of multiple distinct targets of SNU-387, each with a unique chemical structure, suggests that the pathway may involve diverse molecular mechanisms. The integration of these evidence points to a possible role for Decyl propionate in modulating the activity of SNU-387, which in turn affects HCC1937. The relationship is supported by the consistent presence of SNU-387 as a common target across different pathways, reinforcing the hypothesis that Decyl propionate may act through this intermediate to influence HCC1937.",
